            <ArticleTitle>Fatty pain cures.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1311-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this issue, Alvin King, Daniele Piomelli, and colleagues publish another interesting paper on inhibition of monoacylglycerol lipase (MGL). MGL is a hot target for antinociceptive agents, being the chief degrading enzyme of the endocannabinoid 2-arachidonoylglycerol.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
